+## 3. Figma fidelity and known differences
+
+All 17 requested frames were retrieved from the supplied Figma file, including their screenshots and layer/code context. The sparse Events frame was expanded into its child sections, filters, navigation, footer, and month groups before implementation decisions were made.
+
+**Exact visual fidelity has not been verified and is not complete.** Figma asset URLs returned HTML “Site Unavailable” responses rather than image bytes. A separate raw-image export attempt failed the same way. Invalid downloads were removed; no temporary Figma URLs or corrupt image files ship in the source. The existing local imagery remains unchanged. This is a material limitation, especially for the authentication concert background, landing collage, playlist artwork, event artwork not present in the ZIP, and ticket seat-plan image.
+
