+| 705:24443 | About hero | `/about/experience` implements heading, CTA pair and illustrative ticket card. Barcode/perforation/glow assets unavailable; no scannable or supposedly valid ticket is fabricated. |
+| 705:13478 | Attendee hover | Choice-card hover and keyboard-focus styling implemented. |
+| 705:15673 | Organizer hover | Choice-card hover and keyboard-focus styling implemented. |
