+| 705:18706 | Temporary role overlay | Role selector intentionally not implemented. A similarly styled account-access dialog leads to the shared Login page without granting roles. |
+| 705:14121 | Related events | Three-card section uses real items from the current event source, excludes the current event, and avoids repeating one event three times. |
+| 705:15728 | Organizer step 1 | Visual preview with disabled fields and explicit policy notice. Preview navigation only. |
